  "prefLabel": "Occ 103.01 Composition of the Board",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Occ 103.01 Composition of the Board. The board consists of 5 members appointed as specified in RSA 328-F:4, V. The members shall include 3 licensed occupational therapists, one occupational therapy assistant, and one public member.\n\nSource. #8572, eff 1-26-05; ss by #13081, eff 7-31-20 (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Occ 100); ss by #14366, eff 9-9-25",
